<resources>
    <string name="promo_title">Promotions</string>
    <string name="promo_help">Deals the till applies by itself: “3 for RM10”, several prices (2 for RM3, 3 for RM4), a special price (1 for RM3.99) or “buy 1 get 1 free” on one or more products, from a start date to an end date if you like. Only whole units of products sold by the piece count; a line with a hand-made discount or a changed price is left out. Older tills skip what they do not know (a special price before 1.6.1, more prices before 1.15.0): update every till first.</string>
